<title>jpa-bench results</title>
{% include "_style.html.j2" %}
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>jpa-bench results</h1>
<p class="lede">
  JMH benchmark of JPA providers (OpenJPA, Hibernate, EclipseLink) on H2 and PostgreSQL, with identical schema,
  data and settings. Each run is from one machine; compare providers within a run, not runs with each other.
  <a href="datasets.html">Data model and datasets</a> · <a href="{{ repo_url }}">Source and how to contribute a run</a>
</p>

<h2>Runs</h2>
{% if comparable %}
{% set rows = comparable %}{% include "_runs.html.j2" %}
{% else %}
<p class="note">No full runs yet.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if other %}
<h2>Smoke and reduced runs</h2>
<p class="mismatch">Too few forks or iterations for meaningful numbers. Not comparable.</p>
{% set rows = other %}{% include "_runs.html.j2" %}
{% endif %}

<p class="note">Generated {{ generated }}.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
